The Wright brothers beat them to it.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:20.740
There's something else at play here.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:25.361
About three and a half years ago 
I made a discovery

00:01:25.361 --> 00:01:32.900
and this discovery profoundly changed my view on how I thought the world worked

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:35.140
and it even profoundly changed the way in which I operate in it.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:39.560
As it turns out 
there's a pattern.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:40.553
As it turns out

00:01:40.553 --> 00:01:44.060
all the great and inspiring leaders and organizations in the world

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:46.380
whether it's Apple or Martin Luther King 
or the Wright brothers

